  "description": "EIP-3009 ReceiveWithAuthorization (03 \u00a74.4, 05 \u00a72.5; 04 \u00a72.4.1). `typeHashConstant`: the exported type hash. `domainSeparator`: the EIP-712 separator of a token domain, or a rejection. `verifyTokenDomain`: the configured {chainId, verifyingContract} against what the token reports (eip712Domain(), or name(), version() and DOMAIN_SEPARATOR()); accept with the domain's name, version and separator, or reject. `receiveWithAuthorization`: typeHash, domain separator, struct hash and digest (32-byte hex without 0x), or a rejection of a non-canonical authorization. `signReceiveWithAuthorization`: the 0x + 130 hex signature by a test key.",
